class_name V10W1HomeLines
extends RefCounted

# 0.10 wave 1 (Цубамэ, Миэль, Кохаку, Ширин, Злата): every home-side line, one table per founders' consumer, in the
# consumer's own schema and counts (the founder with the fullest set is the template). Pure data, never gated here:
# V10Wave1 merges these tables into the consumers only while V10Wave1.released() (V10W1Home.merges(), README hooks).
#
#   TOUCH        -> V9TouchLines.LINES   (v09/home/touch_lines.gd) zones head/hand/outfit/bg/spam/idle, {t, e}
#   TIME_GREET, CLOCK, DATES, TICKLE, STAR, CAMEO, CAMEO_LOCKED, PEEK_PLAY -> V7Lines.* (v07/eggs/lines.gd)
#   BARKS        -> V6Txt.LINES          (v06/story/txt.gd) all 27 kinds Sfx.say / V6Txt.line read
#   SIGN, PS, LETTERS -> V9LetterText.*  (v09/letters/letter_text.gd) 4 events × 2 variants
#   ARRIVALS, ARRIVAL_TITLES -> V6Scenes.SCENES / TITLES (v06/story/story_scenes.gd) her arrival in the salon
#   GIFT_LINES, ROOM_LINES, OPENERS, MOMENTS, ENDINGS -> V7RoomData.* (v07/room/room_data.gd)
#   ROOM_SCENES  -> V7RoomScenes.SCENES  (v07/room/room_scenes.gd) Симпатия 2 / 4 / 7 / 10
#
# Voice: Цубамэ — строгая профи, коротко, прячет лицо в шарф («Доставлено.»); Миэль — солнечная кормилица,
# перфекционистка макаронов («Попробуй!»); Кохаку — надменная лиса-трикстер, тает от поглаживаний, хвост выдаёт
# («Удача любит меня»); Ширин — игриво-загадочная, притчи, по утрам сонная и ворчливая («Звёзды не лгут»); Злата —
# царственная, тёплая, щедрая, смущается из-за блинов («Весна пришла!»).
# Red lines (docs/HEROINES.md §4): adults, flirt only with the player, nothing about her body or the player's gaze,
# no school, no alcohol, no purchases, no guilt; V10Lint.BANNED stems never appear (V10W1Home.audit checks it).
# The player is addressed in the masculine, as the founders do.

